(A) The coding semimeasure, exact
  latent  : R(pi_H) = 1.500000000000, H(rho) = 1.500000000000
  feature : R(pi_H) = 1.500000000000, H(rho) = 1.500000000000
  max_w sum_b q_w(b) over all trials = 1.000000000000 (must be <= 1)
  max over 20 programs per case of sum over all 3^8 couplings of Q = 1.000000000000 (must be <= 1)
  max of [-log2 Q(beta) - 2^m R(pi)] over 600 programs = -0.127288 (must be <= 0)

(B) Type-class bounds  2^m H(rho) - |B| log2(2^m+1) <= L_beta <= 2^m H(rho)
  rho = [0.5, 0.5]: holds for m = 4, 8, 12, 16, 20; at m = 20: 2^m H - L_beta = 10.33 bits (bound 40.00)
  rho = [0.75, 0.25]: holds for m = 4, 8, 12, 16, 20; at m = 20: 2^m H - L_beta = 10.12 bits (bound 40.00)
  rho = [0.9375, 0.0625]: holds for m = 4, 8, 12, 16, 20; at m = 20: 2^m H - L_beta = 9.28 bits (bound 40.00)
  rho = [0.5, 0.25, 0.25]: holds for m = 4, 8, 12, 16, 20; at m = 20: 2^m H - L_beta = 20.15 bits (bound 60.00)
  rho = [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25]: holds for m = 4, 8, 12, 16, 20; at m = 20: 2^m H - L_beta = 29.98 bits (bound 80.00)

